<title>USA: Chrysler Corp unit sells $300 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Chrysler Corp unit sells $300 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Chrysler Financial Corp, a unit of Chrysler Corp was priced on Wednesday, via Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER CHRYSLER FINANCIAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.95 PCT   MATURITY 3/25/2002</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.896  FIRST PAY DATE 9/25/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 6.975 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 40 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
